                                        "entry_id": "8439e667-c119-38c6-8f48-05bbd1f2317d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exhibiting borderline personality disorder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "453e2e18-94bb-4115-b54a-1f5eeafeb843",
                                                "sense_id": "aa9d8e65-f1ae-3c4b-baf2-abe7103ccff3",
                                                "text": "She clearly has borderline and narcissistic features and she meets the criteria for a rapid cycling bipolar disorder, as well as for a generalized anxiety disorder. She has a severe binge eating disorder and has gained 65 pounds since[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
